        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.554,
            0.49,
            0.698,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "Has last name n, SSN s, and boss b"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.83,
            0.487,
            0.869,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": "**Worker**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.758,
            0.503,
            0.831,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": "lname 'White'"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.764,
            0.535,
            0.836,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": "boss None"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.591,
            0.583,
            0.708,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "use self to assign attributes"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.686,
            0.437,
            0.705
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Evaluating a Constructor Expression"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.714,
            0.282,
            0.729
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Worker('White', 1234, None)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.733,
            0.285,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": "1. Creates a new object (folder) of the class Worker"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.759,
            0.272,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": "§ Instance is initially empty"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.334,
            0.754,
            0.354,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "**id8**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.773,
            0.293,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "2. Puts the folder into heap space"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.408,
            0.768,
            0.446,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "**Worker**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.786,
            0.28,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "3. Executes the method \\_\\_init\\_"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.335,
            0.784,
            0.405,
            0.795
          ],
          "content": "lname 'White'"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.8,
            0.274,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": "§ Passes folder name to self"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.345,
            0.8,
            0.401,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": "ssn 1234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.813,
            0.297,
            0.826
          ],
          "content": "§ Passes other arguments in order"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.826,
            0.286,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": "§ Executes the (assignment) commands in initializer body"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.342,
            0.818,
            0.402,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": "bossNone"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.85,
            0.302,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": "4. Returns the object (folder) name"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.594,
            0.686,
            0.829,
            0.705
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Making Arguments Optional"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.541,
            0.715,
            0.703,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": "• We can assign default values to \\_\\_init\\_\\_ arguments"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.741,
            0.685,
            0.764
          ],
          "content": "§ Write as assignments to parameters in definition"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.764,
            0.685,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": "§ Parameters with default values are optional"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.541,
            0.788,
            0.616,
            0.801
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "• Examples:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.557,
            0.801,
            0.704,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": "§ p = Point3() # (0,0,0)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.716,
            0.715,
            0.819,
            0.727
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "1. class Point3(object):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.815,
            0.704,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": "§ p = Point3(1,2,3) # (1,2,3)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.743,
            0.727,
            0.868,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": "\"\"\"Class for points in 3d space"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.743,
            0.739,
            0.834,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "Invariant: x is a float"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.744,
            0.785,
            0.874,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "def \\_\\_init\\_\\_(self,x=0,y=0,z=0):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.827,
            0.642,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": "§ p = Point3(1,2)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.744,
            0.75,
            0.832,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": "Invariant y is a float"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.744,
            0.762,
            0.832,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": "Invariant z is a float"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.755,
            0.796,
            0.866,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": "\"\"\"Initializes a new Point3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.755,
            0.808,
            0.88,
            0.82
          ],
          "content": "Precond: x,y,z are numbers\"\"\""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.84,
            0.703,
            0.852
          ],
          "content": "§ p = Point3(y=3) # (0,3,0)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.852,
            0.702,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": "§ p = Point3(1,z=2) # (1,0,2)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.756,
            0.82,
            0.8,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "self.x = x"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.756,
            0.832,
            0.799,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "self.y = y"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.756,
            0.843,
            0.799,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": "self.z = z"
        },
